{"kind":"html","caption":"先按区间起点升序排列，再从左到右维护当前合并区间。若新区间的起点不大于当前终点，就扩展右端点；否则保存当前区间并开始新区间。端点相等也算重叠，所以 [1,4] 与 [4,5] 会合并为 [1,5]。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>合并区间可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.app{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}.rule{color:#3794ff;font-size:11px}.mono,.tick{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.status{min-height:auto;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2a2d2e;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.panel{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px}.label{margin-bottom:6px;color:#3794ff;font-size:10px}.timeline{position:relative;height:130px;margin:0 2%;overflow:hidden}.tick{position:absolute;top:108px;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.bar{position:absolute;height:18px;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:24px;border:1px solid #3794ff;background:#173b57;color:#fff;font-size:10px;transition:all .55s ease;opacity:.42}.bar.active{opacity:1;background:#0e639c}.bar.merged{opacity:1;background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.bar.done{opacity:1;background:#264f78}.output{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;min-height:24px}.chip{padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:11px}.chip.new{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.legend{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:4px}.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px}.progress>div{height:100%;background:#3794ff;animation:run 12s linear infinite}@keyframes run{from{width:0}to{width:100%}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"title\">合并区间：排序后线性扫描</div>\n  <div class=\"rule\">判断规则：<span class=\"mono\">下一区间起点 ≤ 当前区间终点</span> 时合并</div>\n  <div class=\"progress\"><div></div></div>\n  <div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"label\">示例 1：<span class=\"mono\">[[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]]</span></div>\n    <div id=\"timeline\" class=\"timeline\"></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"label\">已经确定的结果</div>\n    <div id=\"output\" class=\"output\"></div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#0e639c\"></i>当前处理</span><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#264f78\"></i>已经确定</span><span>端点相等也合并：<span class=\"mono\">[1,4] + [4,5] → [1,5]</span></span></div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst source=[[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]], max=18;\nconst timeline=document.getElementById('timeline'), statusEl=document.getElementById('status'), outputEl=document.getElementById('output');\nfor(let n=0;n<=18;n+=2){const t=document.createElement('span');t.className='tick';t.style.left=(2+n/max*96)+'%';t.textContent=n;timeline.appendChild(t)}\nconst bars=source.map((v,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('div');b.className='bar';b.dataset.i=i;b.style.left=(2+v[0]/max*96)+'%';b.style.width=((v[1]-v[0])/max*96)+'%';b.style.top=(8+i*34)+'px';b.textContent='['+v+']';timeline.appendChild(b);return b});\nconst frames=[\n {s:'区间已按起点排序。取 <b>[1,3]</b> 作为当前合并区间。',a:[0],r:[[1,3]]},\n {s:'检查 <b>[2,6]</b>：<span class=\"mono\">2 ≤ 3</span>，发生重叠，右端点扩展到 <b>6</b>。',a:[0,1],m:[1,6],r:[[1,6]]},\n {s:'检查 <b>[8,10]</b>：<span class=\"mono\">8 &gt; 6</span>，不重叠，保存 <b>[1,6]</b>。',a:[2],d:[0,1],r:[[1,6],[8,10]]},\n {s:'检查 <b>[15,18]</b>：<span class=\"mono\">15 &gt; 10</span>，保存 <b>[8,10]</b>。',a:[3],d:[0,1,2],r:[[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]]},\n {s:'扫描结束，保存最后一个区间。结果恰好覆盖原来的全部区间。',d:[0,1,2,3],r:[[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]],final:true}\n];\nfunction render(k){const f=frames[k];bars.forEach((b,i)=>{b.className='bar';b.style.left=(2+source[i][0]/max*96)+'%';b.style.width=((source[i][1]-source[i][0])/max*96)+'%';b.style.top=(8+i*34)+'px';b.textContent='['+source[i]+']';if((f.a||[]).includes(i))b.classList.add('active');if((f.d||[]).includes(i))b.classList.add('done')});\n if(f.m){bars[0].className='bar merged';bars[0].style.left=(2+f.m[0]/max*96)+'%';bars[0].style.width=((f.m[1]-f.m[0])/max*96)+'%';bars[0].textContent='['+f.m+']';bars[1].style.opacity='.12'}\n statusEl.innerHTML='<b>步骤 '+(k+1)+' / '+frames.length+'</b><br>'+f.s;\n outputEl.innerHTML='';f.r.forEach((v,i)=>{const c=document.createElement('span');c.className='chip mono'+((i===f.r.length-1&&!f.final)?' new':'');c.textContent='['+v+']';outputEl.appendChild(c)})}\nlet step=0;render(step);setInterval(()=>{step=(step+1)%frames.length;render(step)},2400);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
